WEBVTT

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:58.330
I'm home.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:51.230
Oh, yeah. I don't have to go in anymore.

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.520
Morning!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.440
Morning. You're gonna be late!

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.650
Wait!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.390
<b>Service Terminated</b>

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:38.670
Oh. Well, I haven't played in half a year.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.660
MMO recommendations...

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.560
<i>Fruits de Mer</i>?

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.460
<b>Start Playing</b>

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:05.970
The characters look cute, 
and the art is really pretty.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:10.590
<b>Install</b>

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.390
<i>I'm Morioka Moriko.</i>

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.560
<i>Thirty years old. I'm a recent 
corporate dropout and NEET.</i>

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.320
<i>I'm not your average NEET schmuck.</i>

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.410
<i>I </i>chose<i> the NEET life.</i>

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.890
<i>I'm an elite NEET.</i>

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.110
Perfect.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:31.240
My hot guy character is complete.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:32.240
Log in!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.750
Episode 1

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.750
♀ IRL, ♂ Online

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.380
<b>LV 1   Hayashi</b>

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:56.300
<b><u>Lightning of the Black Darkness</u> 
 Beast Shadow
 Darkness Knight 
Heavy Nightmare
Cross of Darkness  
Yuki</b>

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:56.300
Why did I go with a name like Hayashi?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.000
I thought about it too much and 
ended up just confusing myself.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.650
<b>You got a new quest.</b>

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:10.410
All right. Let's do this!

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:29.110
Amen.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.600
I'll get you this time.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.340
Take this!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.540
Amen.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:45.980
This time for sure!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:54.900
Amen.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.820
This is pretty hard.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:04.490
It's completely different from <i>Nanter SG</i>.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.790
<b>New Message</b>

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.790
Um, are you okay?

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:10.920
Are you okay?

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.780
<i>She's an angel!</i>

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:15.970
Um...

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.620
I'm okay.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:21.060
I'm just stuck on a quest. 
I died and came back here.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.210
So that's what happened.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.680
Sh-She's so cute!

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:31.740
I see. That quest is a bit difficult.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.970
And you've only just started, right?

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:35.330
Yes.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:39.830
This game can be a handful when 
you're trying to get the hang of it.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:42.620
But...

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.210
The scenery is so pretty.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.650
It's a totally new world.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.560
And...

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:59.470
It lets us meet totally new people.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:05.100
It makes me feel like role-playing this journey
on my own two feet is just so much fun.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:07.600
So, Mr. Beginner...

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.250
They say no road is long with good company.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.610
Even a chance meeting is due to fate.

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.360
We were lucky enough to meet like this,

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:20.270
so would you care to adventure together?

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.340
<b>You have received a friend request.</b>

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.340
<b>Add Lily-san to your friends list?</b>

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.340
<b>Yes</b>

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.340
<b>No</b>

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:32.050
Yes!

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.010
That's it, Hayashi-san!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.060
By using your shield 
skills at the right time,

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.020
you can reduce the damage
 you take quite a bit!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.390
Now!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.390
I did it!

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:54.700
That went really well!

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:01.790
Congratulations on leveling up!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:05.120
It looks like you're about ready
 to head to the boss room.

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:07.270
Th-The boss?

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:12.170
It'll be fine! I'll be right by your side.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.490
Right! Let's go!

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:21.010
This time for sure.

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:30.190
Hayashi-san!

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:35.400
Leave the healing to me.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.070
Breath of Healing!

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:47.200
My wounds are healing 
right before my eyes...

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:50.330
I can do this.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.380
I... I did it!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.090
Yay! You did it, Hayashi-san!

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:13.280
Yeah! Thanks a lot!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.320
Oh, it's a rare drop.

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:22.040
It's a silver sword. 
That's a pretty good weapon.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:28.650
Now then, Hayashi-san, you've got
 one more shot to test your luck.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.250
Hopefully we'll find
something good there, too.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.770
A thousand gold and bracelets?

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:48.290
Does this count as good luck?

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:50.660
Hmm... A little bit?

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:55.740
Oh, but now we're a matching 
pair... or something?

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.660
Of course! I'll keep it equipped my whole life!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.810
You can unequip it once 
you find something better!

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.620
No. I'll wear them forever!

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.550
Th-That was really fun.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:25.090
I had so much fun. 
Lily-san, thank you. Thank you!

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.860
Lily-san! Lily-san!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.370
You can go inside these sea anemones!

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.270
Look!

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:44.120
I fit right inside.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.540
I want to go inside, too!

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:21.960
It's snowing...

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.340
What's this?

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.880
It looks like it's for Christmas.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:34.530
Even in <i>Fruits de Mer</i>, things 
can get festive just like this.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.540
It kind of gets you excited, doesn't it?

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:42.970
It does.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.130
Christmas...

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.560
I know!

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.550
Hayashi-san, good evening!

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:57.900
Lily-san!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:02.390
Let's go hunting. I heard 
some new monsters spawned.

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:03.390
Sure.

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:07.820
Oh, um... There's actually 
somewhere I wanted to go today.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:09.410
Later!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.290
Hayashi-san?

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:17.790
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.410
Hayashi-san!

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:23.550
Sorry, I'm in a hurry to get somewhere!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.510
Poko-chan, you playing from a net cafe?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.900
Yeah, on the way home from work.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:35.430
It takes me three hours to get 
home, so I'm taking a break.

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:36.480
Three hours?!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.770
It's a bit of a trip, right?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:42.650
You should hurry on home! Don't 
you have someone waiting for you?

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.890
Yup. You've got a point.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:49.400
Hayashi, you fit in completely these days.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.050
Remember when you first started?

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.130
You'd get killed by super weak enemies...

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.060
Take this!

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:07.340
And you had trouble with the controls.

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:11.310
You'd run off randomly at full 
speed in the middle of a fight.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:14.850
It's all thanks to the help I got 
from you and everyone in the guild.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.150
Come on, let's put the formalities behind us.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.780
Time to drink!

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.520
Cheers!

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:36.460
What's the matter? You look lonely.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.500
Hime-san...

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.120
Got some girl problems?

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:45.850
You can tell your big 
brother Himeralda anything.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:46.480
Okay?

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.740
I-I couldn't...

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.900
But...

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:58.160
Hayashi-san and I went into a sea anemone
 together and I felt right at home.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:01.900
I sort of feel like I'd 
like to play with him more.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.870
But it seems like he's avoiding me.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.030
I wonder if I did something.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.670
Goodness.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:15.060
So, what's this about Hayashi?

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.390
Apparently something happened 
between him and Lily-chan.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.260
"Something"?

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:24.040
Both Hayashi-kun and Lily-chan are our 
friends in our guild, @Home Party, right?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:28.270
And you're the guildmaster, 
so go and ask him what's up!

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:29.170
Okay?

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:30.850
Jeez.

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:37.790
Huh?

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.700
Looks like you've been avoiding Lily lately.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.180
Something happen?

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:48.440
Oh... So you invited me to adventure 
with you alone to ask me about that.

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:53.400
I'm sure I told you when you 
first entered our guild.

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:56.180
No romance allowed.

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.060
Wh-What?

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.030
You really are a doofus.

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:02.580
Huh?

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:07.470
While it is true that our 
guild has a no romance policy

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:09.750
and I don't want any drama,

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:12.320
you can just game normally.

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:13.590
Yeah?

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:19.600
Anyway, I'm asking you this 
as a friend, not your GM.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:24.100
Can you just be a good game friend to Lily 
like you always have been up until now?

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.540
With how she looks 
and how kindhearted she is,

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:29.080
surely you can imagine that she 
has to deal with creeps sometimes,

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:33.320
even though she's just here to forget 
about work and things and enjoy the game.

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:37.180
Besides, online games are a strange 
world where there's no telling

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.080
what someone's gender really is.

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:45.640
No need to worry. A game's a game, 
and the real world's the real world.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.530
It's thanks to Lily-san that I'm 
having such a good time now,

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:51.340
so I wanted to give her a token 
of my appreciation in game.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.680
I'm gonna get a certain rare drop 
from this quest on my own.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.920
That's right. It's one you can't buy with money.

00:15:55.920 --> 00:16:00.020
I want to give her a Crystal Rose
 as a Christmas present!

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:04.730
Huh?! That's so corny!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.610
I've thought about it, and simple is best!

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.610
I know my level is too low,

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.360
but I wanted to try and get it on my own.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.460
And I'm sure it'll look great on her!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.750
So, wait, you intend to play from 
now straight until Christmas?

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.950
Lily-san.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.910
H-Hayashi-san?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.060
Are you okay?

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:12.550
I'm fine. I just kind of went 
overboard with a tough quest.

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.160
You need healing.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:18.060
Breath of Healing.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:23.800
Thank you. Um, I was looking for you.

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:26.660
I asked Kanbe-san where you might be.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:35.690
Am I getting in your way?

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:36.700
Huh?

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:41.410
I know... I'm just getting negative on my own.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:45.800
Wh-What's wrong? Lily-san, what happened?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:48.900
I... I don't know what to say to her.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:50.440
How can I understand how a girl feels?

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:51.740
I dunno even though I'm a girl!

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.780
I'm never gonna lose my virginity as a man!

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.620
Wait, I guess that's obvious.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.210
Just kidding!

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:01.930
You're doing great just as you are.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:06.970
If I said anything more,
 I'd just be putting you in a tight spot.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:10.480
But you came to see me
 for a reason, didn't you?

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.910
Are you free Christmas Eve?

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.660
There's something I want to give you.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:23.160
I have work, but I'll try to 
get home as soon as I can.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.660
Great!

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:28.810
So what do you wanna do?

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:31.320
Wanna enjoy a nice drink, 
just two guys on Christmas Eve?

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:33.670
I wish you wouldn't say that.
 It rings painfully hollow.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.170
Don't take me seriously. I was joking.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.230
I've got some plans.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:38.930
Got a date?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.300
That's not it!

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:42.890
That right?

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:45.430
Later! Good work today.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:47.910
Thank you.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.120
Now then...

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:17.780
<i>Damn. There are couples everywhere 
just 'cause it's Christmas Eve.</i>

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:19.710
<i>I must retreat at once...</i>

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:21.880
<i>Or I'll die!</i>

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.490
Thank you very much.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:30.600
Merry Christmas.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.440
Thank you very much.

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:35.400
Welcome.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.900
<b>Christmas Chicken</b>

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:44.110
<i>Stop it! Stop it, stomach!</i>

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.300
Here you are. Thank you very much.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.760
<i>All right, here we are! 
Just bear with it, stomach!</i>

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.970
<i>No, I'm asking the impossible. 
It just won't stop.</i>

00:19:57.970 --> 00:20:00.250
<i>My stomach is playing its own jingle bells.</i>

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:03.260
<i>If I'm going to die of 
embarrassment here anyway...</i>

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.230
<i>I'd rather eat to death!</i>

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:07.260
Miss?

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.500
Thanks for always shopping with us.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:20.900
Excuse me, but can I have the chicken?

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:20.900
Excuse me, but can I have the chicken?

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.800
<i>What was that?!</i>

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:29.610
P-Please, help yourself.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:35.170
<i>I won't be able to come 
to this store for a while!</i>

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:44.870
I had a lot to deal with, but I still 
logged on before Lily-san. What a relief.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:48.560
Hayashi-san!

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:53.560
Did I surprise you? Merry Christmas.

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:56.560
Too surprisingly adorbs!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.080
I have a present.

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:02.280
It's dye you can use on gear when 
you find something you like.

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:04.440
Thank you very much.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.430
I'll be extra, extra careful when I use it!

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:10.980
As for me...

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.270
I got you this.

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:19.330
It's a mini rose brooch.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:24.870
I actually wanted to get you a Crystal Rose,

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:27.130
but this is all I could manage.

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.260
I'm overjoyed.

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:37.320
Gifts like this are the 
true meaning of the season.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:42.470
What I gave you was something 
I paid for, nothing more.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:46.900
This year is the best! Merry Christmas!

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.050
Merry Christmas!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:27.310
Is Hayashi-kun a NEET?

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:30.680
Don't you think there are things 
you're better off not knowing?

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.090
My name is Sakurai Yuta.

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:34.590
That guy was so cool...

00:23:34.900 --> 00:23:38.650
Episode 2, "We Don't Know a Thing."

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Episode 2
We Don't Know a Thing</b>
